  "kind": "on-move passive (PassiveEffects entry: OnChangePositionEffect) plus a branch in Pokemon.removeItems",
  "summary": "When a Silvally is moved to board row y=0 (the bench) through onPokemonChangePosition, the passive returns to the player every held item that is in RemovableItems, in SynergyItems (stones, scales etc. plus Memory Discs), or any item except Rare Candy under the SLAMINGO special game rule, and removes it from the Silvally. In Pokemon.removeItems, when the last held item giving a given synergy is removed from a Silvally, the Silvally loses that synergy unless it is native to the base class, and the player receives the matching Memory Disc if one is not already in the player's items. The passive does nothing in combat.",
